From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 23:30:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] settings: gather our settings under System > Yacer

Move every setting this build adds into one category below CoreELEC's:

- Subtitles: Brightness (05_02), Placement (05_03), Repair and its options
  (07_01), from Player > Subtitles
- Passthrough Audio: the audio lead (11_10) and dialogue normalisation defeat
  (20_02), from System > CoreELEC, whose Passthrough Audio group was ours and
  goes with them
- HDR: HDR10+ to Dolby Vision (20_01), from System > CoreELEC

Dialogue normalisation defeat now applies to AC-3 / E-AC-3 only by default;
TrueHD Atmos and DTS can still be ticked.

The setting ids are unchanged, so saved values carry over, and settings left
behind still depend on them by id. Kodi's and CoreELEC's menus are back to
their own settings.

Signed-off-by: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>
